# RevenueCat PUBLIC SDK key for the Apple app (starts with "appl_").
# Public/client-side by design — NOT the secret API key. Find it in RevenueCat:
#   Project settings → API keys → App-specific "Public app key" for the App Store app.
# !! MUST BE FILLED IN BEFORE BUILDING — empty means IAP silently does not initialize.
